<title>USA: Zag Industries names Amiel Sadeh pres/COO.</title>
<headline>Zag Industries names Amiel Sadeh pres/COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ZAG Industries Ltd said Wednesday it appointed Amiel Sadeh to the newly-created positions of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Sadeh was most recently co-managing director of Israeli-based Delta Galil Industries Ltd, ZAG said.</p>
<p>Israel-based ZAG designs, develops, manufactures and markets plastic consumer products.</p>
